      "final_answer": "**Audit finding:** `brainspace_copilot_bridge.py:124\u2013126` incorrectly says MD-1 \u201conly adds\u201d to retained tools. At lines 354\u2013359, a valid score below threshold **suppresses regex matching** for that family. Tests and documentation confirm this is intentional; the comment is stale.\n\n- `_AGENT_COMMANDS` (line 120) contains `fleet`, `review`, `security-review`, and `research`. Leading slash commands preserve agent tools regardless of MD-1 scores; `/fleet` also preserves SQL. `/rubber-duck` is deliberately excluded as unconfirmed.\n- `MD1_THRESHOLD` (line 165) defaults to `0.5`, with inclusive `>=` comparison. Valid environment overrides span `[0, 1]`; invalid values revert to the default. Missing or invalid family scores fall back to regex routing.\n\nRepository left untouched.",
